## 7. 예제

### 7.1 Button 컴포넌트

```freelang
component Button {
  props {
    label: string
    type: string  // "primary", "secondary"
  }

  style {
    .btn {
      padding: 10px 20px
      border: none
      border-radius: 4px
      cursor: pointer
      font-weight: bold
    }

    .btn.primary {
      background: #007bff
      color: white
    }

    .btn.secondary {
      background: #6c757d
      color: white
    }

    .btn:hover {
      opacity: 0.9
    }
  }

  script {
    fn handle_click(element) {
      console.log("Button clicked:", element.textContent)
    }
  }

  markup {
    <button class="btn {type}" onclick="handle_click(this)">
      {label}
    </button>
  }
}
```

**출력**:

`button.css`:
```css
.btn { padding: 10px 20px; border: none; ... }
.btn.primary { background: #007bff; color: white; }
.btn.secondary { background: #6c757d; color: white; }
.btn:hover { opacity: 0.9; }
```

`button.js`:
```javascript
function handle_click(element) {
  console.log("Button clicked:", element.textContent);
}
```

`button.html`:
```html
<button class="btn ${type}" onclick="handle_click(this)">${label}</button>
```

