## 13. BNF 문법 (간소화)

```
<component> ::= "component" <identifier> "{" <blocks> "}"
<blocks> ::= (<props> | <style> | <script> | <markup>)*
<props> ::= "props" "{" <prop_list> "}"
<prop_list> ::= (<identifier> ":" <type> )*
<style> ::= "style" "{" <css_content> "}"
<script> ::= "script" "{" <js_content> "}"
<markup> ::= "markup" "{" <html_content> "}"
<identifier> ::= [a-zA-Z_][a-zA-Z0-9_]*
<type> ::= "string" | "number" | "boolean" | "array<type>" | "object"
```

